# EDA Automation Enhancement — Walkthrough

## What Changed

All changes were made to [eda_automation.py](file:///c:/Users/laxmi/EDA%20automation/eda_automation.py) (expanded from ~1012 to ~1400 lines).

### 1. MiniMax M2.7 Integration
- **`minimax-m2.7:cloud`** is now the #1 priority model
- Cloud models show ☁️ badge, local models show 💻 in sidebar
- Separate timeout settings for cloud (120s) vs local (300s) models

### 2. Advanced Statistical Tests (New Section)
| Tab | Feature | What it does |
|---|---|---|
| 🔔 Normality | Shapiro-Wilk + D'Agostino tests | Tests if distributions are normal (✅/❌) |
| 🔗 Chi-Square | Independence tests | Tests categorical variable independence with Cramér's V |
| 📉 PCA | Principal Component Analysis | Explained variance chart + 2D scatter projection |
| 🎯 Clustering | KMeans with auto-k | Elbow method + cluster scatter on PCA axes |

### 3. Enhanced Benchmarking
- Scores on 4 dimensions: **Speed**, **Specificity** (numbers/data refs), **Structure** (formatting), **Length**
- **Composite score** with weighted formula
- **Radar chart** comparing top models visually

### 4. AI Auto-Summary *(new sidebar option)*
- One-click executive summary: data quality grade, key patterns, recommendations, use cases, red flags
- Cached per file — regenerate with button

### 5. Multi-Model Consensus *(new sidebar option)*
- Queries up to 3 models with same question
- Shows individual responses in expanders
- Synthesizes consensus highlighting agreements/disagreements

### 6. Improved Prompting
- **Chain-of-thought** structure: understand → identify → analyze → answer
- Added **Confidence Level** section to responses
- Enhanced system role with 7 explicit instructions

### 7. Smart Context Management
- Cloud models get 3000-char context, local get 2000-char
- Automatic truncation to avoid model context window issues

## Verification

- ✅ App starts at `http://localhost:8501` with no errors
- ✅ Dependencies (scipy, scikit-learn) were already installed
- ✅ All 6 models detected including `minimax-m2.7:cloud`

